{
  "title": "Object / File / Block · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "데이터를 객체·파일·디스크 중 어떤 형태로 사용할지 결정합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Object / File / Block</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#guide-1\">세 가지 접근 방식</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#guide-2\">접근 방식 다음에 볼 조건</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>35 / 62</span></div><h1>Object / File / Block</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>스토리지는 <strong>애플리케이션이 데이터를 읽고 쓰는 방식</strong>에 맞춰 선택합니다. 대표적으로 객체 스토리지, 파일 스토리지, 블록 스토리지가 있습니다.</p><p>사진을 주소로 내려받는 서비스, 여러 서버가 같은 폴더를 사용하는 서비스, 운영체제가 설치될 디스크는 필요한 접근 방식이 서로 다릅니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"comparison\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"object-storage\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"file-storage\"></span><h2>세 가지 접근 방식</h2><p><strong>객체:</strong> 데이터를 객체와 고유 이름으로 저장하고 API로 읽고 씁니다. S3가 대표적이며 이미지, 백업, 로그, 분석용 원본 저장에 적합합니다.</p><p><strong>파일:</strong> 파일과 폴더 경로로 접근합니다. 여러 서버가 같은 파일 시스템을 공유할 때 EFS나 FSx를 검토합니다.</p><p><strong>블록:</strong> 디스크처럼 운영체제에 연결합니다. EC2의 부팅 디스크나 데이터베이스의 디스크가 필요하면 EBS를 검토합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"block-storage\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"instance-store\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"durability-and-availability\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"iops-throughput-and-latency\"></span><h2>접근 방식 다음에 볼 조건</h2><p>데이터가 얼마나 오래 보존되어야 하는지, 여러 서버가 동시에 접근하는지, 어느 정도의 지연과 처리량이 필요한지 확인합니다. 읽고 쓰는 양에 따라 IOPS<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>와 처리량 요구도 달라집니다.</p><p>내구성은 데이터를 잃지 않을 가능성이고, 가용성은 필요할 때 데이터에 접근할 수 있는 정도입니다. 백업과 복구 계획까지 포함해 저장소를 선택합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>저장 방식별 대표 서비스</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ul class=\"concept-flow concept-comparison\"><li><strong>객체 · S3</strong><span>API로 객체 읽기·쓰기</span></li><li><strong>파일 · EFS/FSx</strong><span>공유 폴더와 파일 경로</span></li><li><strong>블록 · EBS</strong><span>운영체제에 디스크 연결</span></li></ul><p class=\"diagram-note\">사용하려는 애플리케이션의 접근 방식부터 확인합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>웹사이트의 사진은 S3에, 여러 Linux 서버가 공유할 폴더는 EFS에, EC2 운영체제 디스크는 EBS에 저장합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>IOPS</strong> — 초당 처리할 수 있는 입출력 작업 횟수입니다. 작은 데이터를 자주 읽고 쓰는 작업에서는 초당 전송량과 별도로 확인해야 합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/aws-overview/storage-services.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AWS Storage category iconStorage ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q039/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q039\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q039\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q039</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q039/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance needs an operating-system-visible volume for database files. What type of storage is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q039\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Block storage</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q039\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Object storage</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q039\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DNS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q039\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish/subscribe messaging</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 같은 블록 장치가 파일 시스템을 생성해 사용하는 볼륨이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q040\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q040\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q040</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q040/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web application stores image files by key and serves them over HTTP. Which service should it consider first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon S3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>는 객체 저장과 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 접근에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q047\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q047\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q047</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q047/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Linux EC2 instances in multiple AZs must share the same files through a POSIX/NFS interface. Which service should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q047\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q047\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Each instance's local instance store</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q047\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Regional Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q047\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">One EBS volume directly attached across AZs</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a>형 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 마운트 대상을 통해 여러 Linux 자원에서 공유할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,4\" data-question=\"Q086\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q086\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q086</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q086/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises Windows file application must retain an SMB interface while storing data in AWS. Which TWO services are candidates?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx for Windows File Server</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Amazon EFS over NFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot as a file share</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Route 53 Resolver</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, E</strong> · 관리형 Windows 파일 시스템에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체로 이어지는 하이브리드 파일 인터페이스에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q049\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q049\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q049</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q049/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises application expects an SMB file share, while new files must be stored as objects in S3. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q049\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q049\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An RDS read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q049\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q049\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 온프레미스 파일 인터페이스와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체 저장을 연결한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">이전 용어 <b>Network ACL</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">다음 용어 <b>Placement Group</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
